{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13217991","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13217991","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1321799101:0":{"text":"你……你是大公阁下请来的那位贵客，瓦勒沙家族的祖先……","source_cn":"你……你是大公阁下请来的那位贵客，瓦勒沙家族的祖先……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2245AFDA63381896","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321799102:0":{"text":"拒绝帮亚莲娜的那个人！","source_cn":"拒绝帮亚莲娜的那个人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8126B6F0089284F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321799103:1":{"text":"……用“人”来称呼我早就不合适了，女士。","source_cn":"……用“人”来称呼我早就不合适了，女士。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x106B9898402FD798","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321799104:0":{"text":"你、你是活死人……！","source_cn":"你、你是活死人……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92787EA4EC93DF52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321799105:0":{"text":"不可无礼，莉娅女士！他仍然是我们所效忠的瓦勒沙家族的一员！","source_cn":"不可无礼，莉娅女士！他仍然是我们所效忠的瓦勒沙家族的一员！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0AE7F39661F67E33","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"不可无礼，莉娅女士！他仍然是我们所效忠的瓦勒沙家族的一员！","female":"不可无礼，莉娅女士！他仍然是我们所效忠的瓦勒沙家族的一员！","variant_male_record_index":"152540","variant_female_record_index":"152541","document_title":"","docu